{"id":"34417470","title":"华农，特等奖！总数全省第一！","published_at":"2026-11-04T17:26:00+08:00","published_label":"2026-11-04","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDicCbT4KSDDibTHvtNcuHZREZQlyh6FKuQv6NVIFdNKXPb3ibVS6g5uibFzffiazmkXvTaSARYCGHcNEBWJfjW3mbJqiaTTWcTHHMug/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"近日 第十五届“挑战杯” 中国大学生创业计划竞赛 终审决赛在大连理工大学落幕 华南农业大学团队共斩获9项奖励 其中包括 东北振兴产业升级专项赛特等奖1项、 一等","tags":["科研"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/NmLQEh5WB7cd3RiV9aMSNg","paper_url":"https://m.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34417470","word_count":1019,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T00:21:47+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=2195323138559836160#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcib9OUORJLexR67iaNiaHMVsUPnrMCxOs4d75byZVqb9icp60drwxLtIDbs1v6NLBtGH2FfIrVwwNyQmw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section><section><section><p><span>近日</span></p><p><span>第十五届“挑战杯”</span></p><p><span>中国大学生创业计划竞赛</span></p><p><span>终审决赛在大连理工大学落幕</span></p><p><span><span>华南农业大学团队共斩获9项奖励</span></span></p><p><span>其中包括</span></p><p><span><span>东北振兴产业升级专项赛特等奖1项、</span></span></p><p><span><span>一等奖1项、二等奖1项、三等奖2项</span></span></p><p><span><span>主体赛</span><span>二等奖1项、三等奖3项</span></span></p><p><span><span>获奖数量位列全省高校第一</span></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAC8ALb3EtPdHh1ccfyNibVw8G631SeCulsgYd9U0qe7jKT4PL1ZCC4mAmJ24KjJtYzhR3bn41ajx6EU9DEoicycdaicID8TQcW5E/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><span>参赛师生合影</span></span></p><p><span><span>本届“挑战杯”赛事由共青团中央、教育部、人力资源和社会保障部、中国科协、中国科学院、中国社会科学院、中国工程院、全国学联和辽宁省人民政府共同主办，大连理工大学、共青团辽宁省委承办，以“青春为中国式现代化挺膺担当”为主题，设置系列配套活动。</span></span></p><p><span><span>据了解，本次竞赛设置了主体赛、东北振兴产业升级专项赛以及“揭榜挂帅”专项赛。</span></span><span><span>赛事自启动以来，共吸引全国2700多所高校的300余万名学生参赛。主体赛终审决赛设置先进制造、新一代信息技术、生物医药与健康科技、新能源新材料、现代农业与食品科技、新消费与文化创意、现代服务与社会治理、国际交流合作等8个前沿赛道，全国共751件作品入围。</span></span></p><p><span><span>赛场上，华农学生团队以扎实完备的创业方案、突出的科技创新能力与沉稳专业的现场表现，共同擦亮了学校创新创业的硬核名片。据悉，另有2个项目将于11月中下旬参加“揭榜挂帅”专项赛终审答辩，届时华农在本届赛事的获奖总数将实现历史性突破，充分彰显学校创新创业硬核实力。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>主体赛华农获奖名单</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAkyVbJvic1XbDiawIjSDz8bXznvtr1URnItDDfmnicpsrF7HyribBINzBibK5AJj75bGCLTr0c3pmuC5dy6tpoOUhibnM8KqCVAmS1c/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>东北振兴产业升级专项赛</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>华农获奖名单</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckD19UbrzdCFVnxDUvoNHH9OvWyLNT5nnMxA1ia4mR49aSK8dWF8BpWroOEtdSqjJO3anmQE5mreTbICeelHMMaPDN9fnAicRY8qw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><p><span><span>华农在本届“挑战杯”中国大学生创业计划竞赛中斩获佳绩，既是对参赛团队创新能力、商业实践水平的充分认可，也是学校持续做实双创育人、涵养创新生态的扎实成效。长期以来，华农依托“挑战杯”等科创赛事做实实践育人工作，不断完善项目培育、备赛辅导与配套保障体系，搭建多元孵化、交流对接平台，引导学生走进真实市场场景淬炼创业思维、夯实实践本领。</span></span></p><p><span>接下来</span></p><p><span>华农将继续用好各类科创竞赛平台</span></p><p><span>面向产业需求</span></p><p><span>推动科技成果落地、创业项目转化</span></p><p><span>持续培育一批</span></p><p><span>敢创新、善实干、能攻坚的</span></p><p><span>高素质创新创业青年人才</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAahYlaO0IcVtYR8PE06wQCBAXRpq71RfB0Wfl0MwdIlEaD4AXV1dVu9Ip1rYOibxGQ7r0Z166bpmNC6aicj5IDU6VXGcAMmNDiag/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652900371&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=88e96fd7a62832d3d3d52b930279aa45&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckD5M86hN4Xr9icjVgwjY4maHtURePffEmCicsDEvd4IZUU2hCPVfU4icUUET9kk79DBD4rLG3nWEv7zBLHTpiayicmjhKZVWKNzzLYw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span></strong></span><span><span>华农，冠军！12🥇，刷新记录！</span></span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652884888&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e29a9f08ea6b883f8d677644c36ea3e5&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCjwKOzO8tSkcDqibqX1WOCtDbrWqnDU6caQiaT4hSGGkamSticloIwqibGLVyiamZZg9J0FrwnibujgUZDiaqIwDxseyKazicEgGvJBS4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span></strong></span><span><span>金奖🥇+7，银奖🥈+13，铜奖🥉+50</span></span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652900907&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=29b140eaca6cdf4e8116c962d53aa58e&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAxibkeg2XPZZGm45OEztjbNlsJ22QqTic0UPB98d0Vh8wmrhoHo2ZeYsoiaOtHIQr0mA6gVvia8e9jol61SZkSBhzJKTxvsL6epOg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><s